  "note": "R8.4, Advanced Missions SSD p.139. Point value prints EPV/BPV (112/90). Cloak cost prints 15/4; the 4 applies only to a ship with no warp engines, which is not modelled. The plasma rack refit is how a cartel flying plasma gets it (FP10.0) - the sheet says the Y175 rack chart serves plasma racks too, so the Y175 block covers either fit. OAKDISC (FD4.5) carries HALF its effect: controlMod 1.0 -> 2.0 works, but its other half - lifting the normal Orion limit of one drone or Plasma-D launched per TWO racks, to one per rack - is unbuilt. So is that base limit, so no Orion is currently capped and the engine behaves as though every Orion had OAKDISC. Do NOT express it as control.oakdisc: that is not a ControlSpec field, ca.json carries one and Jackson drops it silently, and a refit setting it is rejected by RefitResolver."
